{"ticker": "MSFT", "source": "yahoo_finance", "id": "b79d5b9a-2c8f-3ce8-a36b-7814a5b1a883", "title": null, "description": null, "url": null, "publisher": null, "published_time_unix": null, "raw": {"id": "b79d5b9a-2c8f-3ce8-a36b-7814a5b1a883", "content": {"id": "b79d5b9a-2c8f-3ce8-a36b-7814a5b1a883", "contentType": "VIDEO", "title": "Are Nvidia, Oracle mega-deals signs of an AI bubble forming?", "description": "<p>While US stocks (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>) are lifted in <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/ai-driven-market-rally-shows-signs-of-overheating-economist-warns-154621428.html\">another AI-fueled rally</a> tied to Nvidia's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) and Oracle's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) latest headlines, could a bubble be starting to form around markets?</p>\n<p>Crossmark Global Investments chief market strategist Victoria Fernandez and Yahoo Finance senior reporters <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/ines-ferre/\">Ines Ferré</a> assess the market conditions that could be signaling a bubble.</p>\n<p>Also catch Asterozoa Capital's Joe Hegener illustrate whether investors are <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/ai-bubble-forming-could-pouring-140531864.html\">pouring \"gasoline on the fire\" </a>as an AI-driven bubble could be forming around markets.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>", "summary": "While US stocks (^DJI, ^IXIC, ^GSPC) are lifted in another AI-fueled rally tied to Nvidia's (NVDA) and Oracle's (ORCL) latest headlines, could a bubble be starting to form around markets? Crossmark Global Investments chief market strategist Victoria Fernandez and Yahoo Finance senior reporters Brooke DiPalma and Ines Ferré assess the market conditions that could be signaling a bubble. Also catch Asterozoa Capital's Joe Hegener illustrate whether investors are pouring \"gasoline on the fire\" as an AI-driven bubble could be forming around markets. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Opening Bid.", "pubDate": "2025-09-24T15:15:00Z", "displayTime": "", "isHosted": true, "bypassModal": false, "previewUrl": null, "thumbnail": {"originalUrl": "https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-09/861d98e0-9952-11f0-bff7-28d1d9144447", "originalWidth": 6046, "originalHeight": 3395, "caption": "", "resolutions": [{"url": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/ltaG8HZyMN4Of1SrjtJBaw--~B/aD0zMzk1O3c9NjA0NjthcHBpZD15dGFjaHlvbg--/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-09/861d98e0-9952-11f0-bff7-28d1d9144447", "width": 6046, "height": 3395, "tag": "original"}, {"url": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/SDYa3h5uPOYx64hP8Q1o4g--~B/Zmk9c3RyaW07aD0xMjg7dz0xNzA7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-09/861d98e0-9952-11f0-bff7-28d1d9144447", "width": 170, "height": 128, "tag": "170x128"}]}, "provider": {"displayName": "Yahoo Finance Video", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/"}, "canonicalUrl": {"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/video/nvidia-oracle-mega-deals-signs-151500781.html", "site": "finance", "region": "US", "lang": "en-US"}, "clickThroughUrl": {"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/video/nvidia-oracle-mega-deals-signs-151500781.html", "site": "finance", "region": "US", "lang": "en-US"}, "metadata": {"editorsPick": true}, "finance": {"premiumFinance": {"isPremiumNews": false, "isPremiumFreeNews": false}}, "storyline": null}}, "ingested_at": "2025-09-24T20:11:23.560885Z"}
{"ticker": "MSFT", "source": "yahoo_finance", "id": "cf778e9a-159b-31c8-89f1-e37693076350", "title": null, "description": null, "url": null, "publisher": null, "published_time_unix": null, "raw": {"id": "cf778e9a-159b-31c8-89f1-e37693076350", "content": {"id": "cf778e9a-159b-31c8-89f1-e37693076350", "contentType": "VIDEO", "title": "Is an AI bubble forming? We could be pouring gas 'on the fire.'", "description": "<p>While more tech giants invest heavily into artificial intelligence — Nvidia's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) multibillion-dollar investments <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/intels-biggest-problem-isnt-going-away-with-nvidias-5-billion-stake-204800300.html\">in Intel</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/INTC\">INTC</a>) and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/nvidia-stock-jumps-on-100-billion-openai-investment-as-huang-touts-biggest-ai-infrastructure-project-in-history-171740509.html\">OpenAI</a>, Alibaba (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BABA\">BABA</a>)<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/stock-rebound-micron-earnings-alibaba-130444986.html\"> raising its AI spending </a>past $50 billion — is an AI bubble starting to form around markets (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>)?</p>\n<p>Asterozoa Capital CIO Joe Hegener sits down with Morning Brief host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> to analyze whether a bubble could be forming around equity markets, driven by AI and the Federal Reserve cutting interest rates.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>", "summary": "While more tech giants invest heavily into artificial intelligence — Nvidia's (NVDA) multibillion-dollar investments in Intel (INTC) and OpenAI, Alibaba (BABA) raising its AI spending past $50 billion — is an AI bubble starting to form around markets (^DJI, ^IXIC, ^GSPC)? Asterozoa Capital CIO Joe Hegener sits down with Morning Brief host Julie Hyman to analyze whether a bubble could be forming around equity markets, driven by AI and the Federal Reserve cutting interest rates. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Morning Brief.", "pubDate": "2025-09-24T14:05:31Z", "displayTime": "", "isHosted": true, "bypassModal": false, "previewUrl": null, "thumbnail": {"originalUrl": "https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-09/2cfbf020-994f-11f0-8f36-743349dbc338", "originalWidth": 6780, "originalHeight": 3819, "caption": "", "resolutions": [{"url": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/mkRl4l_uaWeP6ycZf.ynqA--~B/aD0zODE5O3c9Njc4MDthcHBpZD15dGFjaHlvbg--/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-09/2cfbf020-994f-11f0-8f36-743349dbc338", "width": 6780, "height": 3819, "tag": "original"}, {"url": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/UFqTW0rxaALyD3aDmfpPmw--~B/Zmk9c3RyaW07aD0xMjg7dz0xNzA7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-09/2cfbf020-994f-11f0-8f36-743349dbc338", "width": 170, "height": 128, "tag": "170x128"}]}, "provider": {"displayName": "Yahoo Finance Video", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/"}, "canonicalUrl": {"url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/video/ai-bubble-forming-could-pouring-140531864.html", "site": "finance", "region": "US", "lang": "en-US"}, "clickThroughUrl": {"url": "https://finance.ya